:26,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"26:8","t":"Indeed in that is a sign, but most of them were not to be believers.","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"26:9","t":"And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful.","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"26:10","t":"And [mention] when your Lord called Moses, [saying], \"Go to the wrongdoing people -","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"26:11","t":"The people of Pharaoh. Will they not fear Allāh?\"","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"26:12","t":"He said, \"My Lord, indeed I fear that they will deny me","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"26:13","t":"And that my breast will tighten and my tongue will not be fluent, so send for Aaron.","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":13,"sd":null},{"k":"26:14","t":"And they have upon me a [claim due to] sin, so I fear that they will kill me.\"","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"26:15","t":"[Allāh] said, \"No. Go both of you with Our signs; indeed, We are with you, listening.","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"26:16","t":"Go to Pharaoh and say, 'We are the messengers of the Lord of the worlds,","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"26:17","t":"[Commanded to say], \"Send with us the Children of Israel.\"'\"","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"26:18","t":"[Pharaoh] said, \"Did we not raise you among us as a child, and you remained among us for years of your life?","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"26:19","t":"And [then] you did your deed which you did, and you were of the ungrateful.\"","j":19,"h":37,"s":26,"a":19,"sd":null}],"juz":19,"hizb":37,"surahs":[26],"sajdah":false}